Subject: [PATCH v5 7/7] perf dso: Use container_of to avoid a pointer in dso_data
From: Ian Rogers <irogers@google.com>
To: Peter Zijlstra <peterz@infradead.org>, Ingo Molnar <mingo@redhat.com>, 
